//- Full-page Agent Chat — matches floating chatbot design
div(class="flex flex-col h-full min-h-0 w-full bg-white")

    //- Header
    div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-fuchsia-100 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950 via-violet-950 to-fuchsia-950 px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 sm:py-5 text-white")
        div(class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4")
            div(class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-fuchsia-300/30 bg-white/10 p-1.5")
                img(src="/assets/brand/plasma-robot.svg", alt="Plasma robot", class="h-full w-full rounded-xl object-cover")
            div(class="min-w-0")
                div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                    span(class="text-[16px] font-semibold") {{robotProfile.name}}
                    span(*ngIf="robotProfile.tag", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-fuchsia-300/30 bg-fuchsia-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-fuchsia-100") {{robotProfile.tag}}
                p(class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-fuchsia-100/80") {{robotProfile.subtitle}}
        div(class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2")
            button(*ngIf="collectionSelected && selectedCollection", (click)="changeCollection()", class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-fuchsia-50 transition-colors hover:bg-white/20", title="컬렉션 변경")
                span 📦
                span(class="max-w-[120px] truncate") {{selectedCollection}}
            button((click)="clearChat()", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-fuchsia-100/80 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white", title="대화 초기화")
                svg(xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1.5", stroke="currentColor", class="size-5")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182")

    //- Collection Selection Screen
    div(*ngIf="!collectionSelected", class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto bg-slate-50 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 py-6 sm:py-8")
        div(class="flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center")
            div(*ngIf="collectionsLoading", class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4")
                div(class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full border-[3px] border-cyan-400 border-t-transparent animate-spin")
                p(class="text-[14px] text-slate-500") 데이터베이스 로딩 중...
            div(*ngIf="!collectionsLoading", class="w-full max-w-[min(48rem,100%)]")
                div(class="mb-8 text-center")
                    div(class="mx-auto mb-5 flex h-28 w-28 items-center justify-center rounded-[32px] border border-fuchsia-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 via-violet-950 to-fuchsia-950 p-4 shadow-[0_24px_50px_rgba(88,28,135,0.2)]")
                        img(src="/assets/brand/plasma-robot.svg", alt="Plasma robot", class="h-full w-full rounded-[22px] object-cover")
                    p(class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-slate-900") {{robotProfile.name}}
                    p(class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-500 max-w-[min(28rem,100%)] mx-auto") 논문 검색에 사용할 컬렉션을 선택하면 실제 에이전트 오케스트레이션 실행 상태를 실시간으로 보여드립니다.
                div(*ngIf="collections.length === 0", class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-8 text-center")
                    p(class="text-[14px] font-medium text-slate-600") 사용 가능한 컬렉션이 없습니다.
                    p(class="mt-2 text-[12px] text-slate-400") 먼저 임베딩 페이지에서 PDF를 업로드하세요.
                div(*ngIf="collections.length > 0", class="space-y-4")
                    div(class="rounded-2xl border border-fuchsia-100 bg-fuchsia-50/60 px-5 py-4 text-[13px] text-fuchsia-800")
                        span(class="font-semibold") AGENT READY
                        span(class="ml-2 text-fuchsia-700/80") 컬렉션 선택 후 오케스트레이션 계획, 참고 문헌, 도구 실행 로그를 함께 표시합니다.
                    div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                        button(*ngFor="let col of collections", (click)="selectCollection(col.name)", class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-all", [ngClass]="selectedCollection === col.name ? 'border-fuchsia-500 bg-fuchsia-50 text-fuchsia-700 shadow ring-1 ring-fuchsia-200' : 'border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-700 hover:border-fuchsia-300 hover:bg-fuchsia-50 hover:text-fuchsia-700'")
                            span(class="text-base") 📄
                            span {{col.name}}
                            span(class="text-[11px] text-slate-400") {{col.total_docs}} docs

    //- Chat Body
    div(*ngIf="collectionSelected", #chatBody="", class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#fdf4ff_0%,#faf5ff_48%,#f8fafc_100%)] px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 py-4 sm:py-6 space-y-5")

        //- Welcome Screen (no messages)
        div(*ngIf="chatMessages.length === 0", class="flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center text-center")
            div(class="relative mb-5 flex h-28 w-28 items-center justify-center rounded-[32px] border border-fuchsia-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 via-violet-950 to-fuchsia-950 p-4 shadow-[0_28px_60px_rgba(88,28,135,0.18)]")
                img(src="/assets/brand/plasma-robot.svg", alt="Plasma robot", class="h-full w-full rounded-[22px] object-cover")
            p(class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-slate-900") {{robotProfile.name}}
            p(class="mt-2 max-w-[min(32rem,100%)] text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-500") 군집형 에이전트가 목표 달성 전까지 계획·수집·분석·정리를 반복하면서 페이지 결과 기반 답변을 만듭니다.
            div(class="mt-6 grid w-full max-w-[min(40rem,100%)] grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3")
                button(*ngFor="let s of suggestions", (click)="sendChat(s.text)", class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left text-[13px] text-slate-600 transition-all hover:border-fuchsia-300 hover:bg-fuchsia-50 hover:text-fuchsia-700")
                    span(class="text-lg") {{s.icon}}
                    span(class="truncate") {{s.text}}

        //- Messages
        ng-container(*ngFor="let msg of chatMessages; let i = index")
            //- User message
            div(*ngIf="msg.role === 'user'", class="flex justify-end")
                div(class="max-w-[92%] sm:max-w-[84%] xl:max-w-[72%] rounded-3xl rounded-br-md bg-fuchsia-600 px-4 sm:px-5 py-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-white shadow-sm whitespace-pre-wrap") {{msg.content}}

            //- Assistant message
            div(*ngIf="msg.role === 'assistant'", class="flex justify-start")
                div(class="max-w-[96%] sm:max-w-[90%] xl:max-w-[80%] space-y-4")
                    //- Collapsed view
                    button(*ngIf="msg.collapsed", (click)="toggleCollapse(msg)", class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-4 text-left text-[13px] text-slate-500 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50")
                        div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3")
                            span(class="truncate") ▶ {{getCollapsedPreview(msg)}}
                            span(class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-500") 최신 외 턴 접힘

                    ng-container(*ngIf="!msg.collapsed")
                        //- Trace Card
                        div(class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm")
                            button((click)="msg.traceCompleted && toggleTrace(msg)", class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/80 px-5 py-4 text-left")
                                div(class="min-w-0")
                                    div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                                        span(class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-slate-900") 답변 생성 과정
                                        span(class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium", [ngClass]="getTraceStatusClasses(getCurrentTraceStep(msg)?.status || 'pending')") {{getCurrentTraceStep(msg)?.title || '정리 중'}}
                                    p(class="mt-1 text-[12px] text-slate-500") {{getVisibleAnswerJourney(msg).length}} / {{getAnswerJourneyCount(msg)}}개 과정 표시 · {{msg.traceCategory}} · {{msg.traceDifficulty}}
                                    div(class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200")
                                        div(class="h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 via-violet-500 to-fuchsia-500 transition-all duration-500", [style.width.%]="getJourneyProgressPercent(msg)")
                                    div(*ngIf="!msg.traceCompleted", class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5")
                                        span(*ngFor="let chip of getCardStageChips(msg)", class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium transition-all", [ngClass]="getCardStageChipClasses(chip.status)")
                                            span {{chip.icon}}
                                            span {{chip.label}}
                                span(class="text-[12px] text-slate-400") {{msg.traceCompleted ? (msg.traceOpen ? '접기' : '펼치기') : '진행 중'}}

                            div(*ngIf="!msg.traceCompleted || msg.traceOpen", class="space-y-2.5 px-5 py-5")
                                //- Current step
                                div(class="journey-reveal journey-reveal-current rounded-2xl border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50/70 px-4 py-3", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getJourneyAnimationDelay(0, 20)")
                                    div(class="flex items-start gap-3")
                                        div(class="flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/70 bg-white/80 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700") ⚙️
                                        div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                                            div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2")
                                                span(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-slate-900") 현재 진행 단계
                                                span(class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium", [ngClass]="getTraceStatusClasses(getCurrentTraceStep(msg)?.status || 'pending')") {{getTraceStatusLabel(getCurrentTraceStep(msg)?.status || 'pending')}}
                                            p(class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-700 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words") {{getCurrentTraceStep(msg)?.detail || msg.currentDescription || '질문을 분석하고 있습니다.'}}

                                //- Journey steps
                                div(*ngFor="let item of getVisibleAnswerJourney(msg); let idx = index", class="journey-reveal rounded-2xl border px-4 py-3", [ngClass]="getTraceStepClasses(item)", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getJourneyAnimationDelay(idx + 1, 60)")
                                    div(class="flex items-start gap-3")
                                        div(class="flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/70 bg-white/80 text-[12px] font-semibold text-slate-700") {{item.icon}}
                                        div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                                            div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2")
                                                span(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-slate-900") {{item.title}}
                                                span(class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium", [ngClass]="getTraceStatusClasses(item.status)") {{getTraceStatusLabel(item.status)}}
                                            p(class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-600 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words") {{item.detail}}

                                //- Hidden steps hint
                                div(*ngIf="getHiddenJourneyCount(msg) > 0", class="journey-reveal rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getJourneyAnimationDelay(getVisibleAnswerJourney(msg).length + 1, 80)")
                                    p(class="text-[12px] text-slate-500") 이후 {{getHiddenJourneyCount(msg)}}개 단계는 진행 상황에 맞춰 차례대로 표시됩니다.

                                //- Upcoming step
                                div(*ngIf="getUpcomingTraceStep(msg)", class="journey-reveal rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-violet-200 bg-violet-50/60 px-4 py-3", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getJourneyAnimationDelay(getVisibleAnswerJourney(msg).length + 2, 110)")
                                    p(class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-violet-800") 다음 예정 단계
                                    p(class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-violet-700") {{getUpcomingTraceStep(msg)?.title}} · {{getUpcomingTraceStep(msg)?.summary || getUpcomingTraceStep(msg)?.detail}}

                                //- Next pending cards preview
                                div(*ngIf="getNextPendingCards(msg).length > 0", class="journey-reveal rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-fuchsia-200 bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-50/50 to-violet-50/50 px-4 py-3", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getJourneyAnimationDelay(getVisibleAnswerJourney(msg).length + 3, 130)")
                                    p(class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-fuchsia-700/80 mb-2") 다음에 올 카드
                                    div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5")
                                        span(*ngFor="let card of getNextPendingCards(msg)", class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-fuchsia-200 bg-white/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium text-fuchsia-600")
                                            span {{card.icon}}
                                            span {{card.label}}
                                            span(class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-300 animate-pulse")

                        //- Navigation Card
                        div(*ngIf="shouldRenderNavigationCard(msg)", class="journey-reveal rounded-3xl border px-5 py-5", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getResultCardAnimationDelay('navigation')", [ngClass]="(msg.navigationCard?.loading ? 'border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50/70' : 'border-cyan-300 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-50 to-blue-50')")
                            div(class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2")
                                span(class="text-lg") 🧭
                                span(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-cyan-800") 페이지 이동
                                span(*ngIf="msg.navigationCard?.loading", class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-100/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-cyan-600")
                                    span(class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 animate-pulse")
                                    span 준비 중
                            div(*ngIf="msg.navigationCard?.loading", class="space-y-2")
                                div(class="h-3 w-3/4 rounded-full bg-cyan-200 animate-pulse")
                                div(class="h-3 w-1/2 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 animate-pulse")
                                p(class="mt-2 text-[12px] text-cyan-600") {{msg.navigationCard?.summary || '질문에 맞는 페이지와 탭을 계산하고 있습니다.'}}
                            div(*ngIf="!msg.navigationCard?.loading")
                                div(class="text-[13px] text-cyan-700") {{msg.navigationCard?.summary || buildAgentNavigationSummary(pendingNavigation)}}
                                button(*ngIf="pendingNavigation", (click)="navigateNow()", class="mt-3 flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl bg-cyan-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-cyan-500")
                                    span {{msg.navigationCard?.actionLabel || '바로 이동'}}

                        //- Page Result Card
                        div(*ngIf="shouldRenderPageResultCard(msg)", class="journey-reveal rounded-3xl border px-5 py-5", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getResultCardAnimationDelay('pageResult')", [ngClass]="msg.pageResultCard.loading ? 'border-violet-100 bg-violet-50/50' : 'border-violet-200 bg-violet-50/70'")
                            div(class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2")
                                span(class="text-lg") 🧾
                                span(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-violet-800") 실행된 페이지 결과
                                span(*ngIf="msg.pageResultCard.loading", class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-violet-200 bg-violet-100/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-violet-600")
                                    span(class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500 animate-pulse")
                                    span 분석 중
                            div(*ngIf="msg.pageResultCard.loading", class="space-y-2")
                                div(class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-violet-700")
                                    span {{msg.pageResultCard.page}}
                                    span ·
                                    span {{msg.pageResultCard.tab}}
                                div(class="h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-violet-200 animate-pulse")
                                div(class="h-3 w-2/3 rounded-full bg-violet-100 animate-pulse")
                                p(class="mt-1 text-[12px] text-violet-600") {{msg.pageResultCard.summary}}
                            div(*ngIf="!msg.pageResultCard.loading")
                                p(class="text-[13px] font-medium text-violet-900") {{msg.pageResultCard.page}} / {{msg.pageResultCard.tab}}
                                p(class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-6 text-violet-700") {{msg.pageResultCard.summary}}
                                p(*ngIf="msg.pageResultCard.query", class="mt-2 text-[12px] text-violet-700") 질문 키워드: {{msg.pageResultCard.query}}
                                p(*ngIf="msg.pageResultCard.paramsText", class="mt-1 text-[12px] text-violet-700") 적용 인자값: {{msg.pageResultCard.paramsText}}
                                div(*ngIf="msg.pageResultCard.evidenceLines?.length > 0", class="mt-2 space-y-1")
                                    p(*ngFor="let line of msg.pageResultCard.evidenceLines", class="text-[12px] leading-5 text-violet-700") • {{line}}

                        //- Answer Card
                        div(*ngIf="shouldRenderAnswerCard(msg)", class="journey-reveal rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-5", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getResultCardAnimationDelay('answer')")
                            div(class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2")
                                span(class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-700") 🤖
                                div
                                    p(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-slate-900") 최종 답변
                                    p(class="text-[12px] text-slate-500") 최신 턴만 펼쳐집니다.
                            div(*ngIf="msg.content", class="text-[14px] leading-7 text-slate-800 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words")
                                | {{getDisplayedAssistantContent(msg)}}
                                span(*ngIf="msg.typingActive", class="ml-0.5 inline-block h-4 w-[1px] animate-pulse bg-slate-400 align-middle")
                            div(*ngIf="!msg.content", class="space-y-2")
                                p(class="text-[12px] font-medium text-slate-500") 현재까지 핵심 포인트
                                p(*ngFor="let line of getAssistantPreviewLines(msg)", class="text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-700") • {{line}}
                                div(class="flex items-center gap-1 pt-1")
                                    div(class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-300 animate-bounce", style="animation-delay: 0ms")
                                    div(class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-300 animate-bounce", style="animation-delay: 150ms")
                                    div(class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-300 animate-bounce", style="animation-delay: 300ms")

                        //- Quality Card
                        div(*ngIf="shouldRenderQualityCard(msg)", class="journey-reveal rounded-3xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60 px-5 py-5", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getResultCardAnimationDelay('quality')")
                            div(class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2")
                                span(class="text-lg") 🧪
                                span(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-emerald-800") 답변 품질 분석
                            div(*ngIf="getQualityBadges(msg).length > 0", class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5")
                                span(*ngFor="let badge of getQualityBadges(msg)", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-emerald-700") {{badge}}
                            p(*ngIf="msg.answerQuality?.detail", class="text-[13px] leading-6 text-emerald-800") {{msg.answerQuality.detail}}
                            p(*ngIf="!msg.answerQuality?.detail", class="text-[13px] leading-6 text-emerald-700") 근거 수, 검증 포인트, 표현 품질을 점검하며 답변 신뢰도를 높이고 있습니다.
                            div(*ngIf="msg.answerQuality?.synthesisPoints?.length > 0", class="mt-2 space-y-1")
                                p(*ngFor="let point of msg.answerQuality.synthesisPoints", class="text-[12px] leading-5 text-emerald-700") • {{point}}
                            div(*ngIf="msg.answerQuality?.verificationChecks?.length > 0", class="mt-2 space-y-1")
                                p(*ngFor="let check of msg.answerQuality.verificationChecks", class="text-[12px] leading-5 text-emerald-700") ✓ {{check}}

                        //- Evidence Card
                        div(*ngIf="shouldRenderEvidenceCard(msg)", class="journey-reveal rounded-3xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/60 overflow-hidden", [style.animationDelay.ms]="getResultCardAnimationDelay('evidence')")
                            button((click)="toggleEvidence(msg)", class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-amber-100/60")
                                div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                                    span(class="text-lg") 📚
                                    span(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-amber-800") 근거 문헌 상세 ({{msg.evidenceItems.length}}건)
                                svg(xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor", class="size-4 text-amber-600 transition-transform", [ngClass]="{'rotate-180': msg.evidenceOpen}")
                                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5")
                            div(*ngIf="msg.evidenceOpen", class="border-t border-amber-200 px-5 py-4 space-y-2.5 max-h-96 overflow-y-auto")
                                div(*ngFor="let ev of msg.evidenceItems; let i = index", class="rounded-xl border border-amber-100 bg-white px-4 py-3")
                                    div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2")
                                        span(class="text-[12px] font-medium text-amber-900 truncate flex-1") {{i + 1}}. {{ev.filename || ev.doc_id || '문서'}}
                                        span(*ngIf="ev.score !== null && ev.score !== undefined", class="flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-amber-700") 유사도 {{formatEvidenceScore(ev.score)}}
                                    div(*ngIf="ev.snippets?.length > 0", class="mt-1.5 space-y-1")
                                        p(*ngFor="let snip of ev.snippets", class="text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-600 break-words") {{snip}}

        //- Loading indicator
        div(*ngIf="chatLoading", class="flex justify-start")
            div(class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm")
                div(class="flex items-center gap-1")
                    div(class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-400 animate-bounce", style="animation-delay: 0ms")
                    div(class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-400 animate-bounce", style="animation-delay: 150ms")
                    div(class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-400 animate-bounce", style="animation-delay: 300ms")

    //- Input Area
    div(*ngIf="collectionSelected", class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-5")
        div(class="flex items-end gap-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto")
            div(class="relative flex-shrink-0")
                div(class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-fuchsia-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 via-violet-950 to-fuchsia-950 p-1.5")
                    img(src="/assets/brand/plasma-robot.svg", alt="Plasma robot", class="h-full w-full rounded-xl object-cover")
            div(class="flex-1")
                textarea(#chatInputEl="", [(ngModel)]="chatInput", (keydown)="onKeydown($event)", placeholder="플라즈마 관련 질문을 입력하세요...", rows="1", class="max-h-32 w-full resize-none rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 px-5 py-3.5 text-[14px] leading-6 text-slate-800 outline-none transition-colors focus:border-fuchsia-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-fuchsia-100", [disabled]="chatLoading")
            button(*ngIf="!chatLoading", (click)="sendChat()", [disabled]="!chatInput.trim()", class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-fuchsia-600 text-white transition-colors hover:bg-fuchsia-500 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40")
                svg(xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor", class="size-5")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5")
            button(*ngIf="chatLoading", (click)="cancelChat()", class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-500 text-white transition-colors hover:bg-rose-400")
                svg(xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor", class="size-5")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M5.25 7.5A2.25 2.25 0 017.5 5.25h9a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25v9a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-9a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25v-9z")
